OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged over death of
OL,4,A21-year-old in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage man has been charged over the
OL,7,Fdeath of a man after a disturbance in
OL,8,FGlasgow city centre.
OL,10,FDaniel Colrain, 21, was found with
OL,11,Fserious injuries in Royal Exchange
OL,12,FSquare at about 03:05 on Sunday. He was
OL,13,Ftaken to hospital where he died on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland said a 19-year-old man
OL,17,Fhad been arrested and charged in
OL,18,Fconnection with the death. He is due to
OL,19,Fappear at Glasgow Sheriff Court later.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
