OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged over death of
OL,4,A21-year-old in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Jonny MacKinnon thanked the
OL,7,Fpublic for their assistance and the
OL,8,Fforce said inquires into the incident
OL,9,Fremain ongoing.
